      "id": "2026-10-30-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "爷爷听见了",
      "title_en": "Grandpa heard",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "爷爷", "今年", "七十", "岁", "了", "。", "他", "非常", "爱", "曼联", "。"],
        ["他", "常常", "在", "家", "看", "球", "。", "有时候", "他", "看", "着", "看", "着", "就", "睡", "了", "。"],
        ["今天", "晚上", "，", "他", "也", "睡", "了", "。", "曼联", "进", "了", "一", "个", "球", "，", "我", "大", "叫", "：", "“", "进", "了", "！", "”"],
        ["爷爷", "听见", "了", "，", "马上", "站", "起来", "：", "“", "什么", "？", "谁", "进", "的", "？", "”"],
        ["我们", "都", "笑", "了", "。", "爷爷", "说", "：", "“", "下次", "我", "不", "睡", "了", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "My grandpa is seventy this year. He absolutely loves Man United.",
        "He often watches football at home. Sometimes he dozes off while he's watching.",
        "This evening he fell asleep again. When Man United scored, I shouted: “Goal!”",
        "Grandpa heard and jumped straight up: “What? Who scored?”",
        "We all laughed. Grandpa said: “Next time I won’t fall asleep!”"
      ],
      "names": ["曼联"],
      "new_words": ["爷爷", "听见"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "爷爷", "english": "grandpa (dad's dad)" },
        { "word": "听见", "english": "to hear" },
        { "word": "曼联", "english": "Manchester United" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-30-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "business & finance",
      "title_zh": "贵的水果",
      "title_en": "Expensive fruit",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "六", "点", "下班", "。", "下班", "后", "，", "我", "去", "买", "水果", "。"],
        ["水果", "很", "贵", "，", "我", "花", "了", "一百", "块", "！", "我", "觉得", "太", "贵", "了", "。"],
        ["第二", "天", "，", "我", "去", "了", "一", "个", "老", "地方", "。", "那里", "的", "水果", "一样", "好", "，", "要", "五十", "块", "。"],
        ["我", "少", "花", "了", "一半", "的", "钱", "！", "真", "好", "。"],
        ["我", "告诉", "了", "朋友", "们", "。", "现在", "，", "他们", "也", "去", "那里", "买", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I finish work at six. After work I went to buy fruit.",
        "The fruit was expensive — I spent a hundred kuai! I thought that was too much.",
        "The next day I went to an old place. The fruit there was just as good, and it was fifty kuai.",
        "I spent half as much! Brilliant.",
        "I told my friends. Now they buy there too."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["下班", "水果"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "下班", "english": "to finish work" },
        { "word": "水果", "english": "fruit" }
      ]
    }
  ],
